WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.520
- I hear I owe your friend.
This is a funny story.

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.900
Your friend's name is Braeden, right?

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.920
That I owe an apology?

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.840
- [Lukas Gage] Yes. Yeah.
Braeden Lemasters. He's an actor.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.700
He is in the band The Wallows.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.320
I ditched...I think it might have been

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.450
his 21st birthday party
to go to your concert.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.722
- [Kelly Clarkson] This
is a horrible story!

00:00:14.722 --> 00:00:15.930
- I know, I know.

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:18.000
It was... I invited a bunch of friends

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.138
that had never met him,

00:00:19.138 --> 00:00:23.527
and I have these texts
from I think 2019 saying,

00:00:23.527 --> 00:00:27.347
"I'm so sorry, I have to bail on you.

00:00:27.347 --> 00:00:29.027
It's Kelly Clarkson."

00:00:29.027 --> 00:00:31.860
(audience laughs)

00:00:33.564 --> 00:00:34.593
- [Lukas Gage] "Babe,
it's Kelly Clarkson."

00:00:34.593 --> 00:00:35.426
- [Kelly Clarkson] He's
going to be truly confused

00:00:35.426 --> 00:00:36.663
if we show up without you.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:38.970
- [Lukas Gage] Some people wait a lifetime

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.358
for a moment like this.

00:00:40.358 --> 00:00:42.193
(audience laughs)

00:00:42.193 --> 00:00:45.210
- I love that you invited
people to your friend's party

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:48.330
that he doesn't know, and
then you were like, deuces.

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.260
- [Lukas Gage] I mean, listen.

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:50.700
- [Kelly Clarkson]
That's incredibly funny.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:51.973
- [Lukas Gage] Yeah, I did it for you.

00:00:51.973 --> 00:00:52.806
- [Kelly Clarkson] Still friends?

00:00:52.806 --> 00:00:53.639
- Still friends.

00:00:53.639 --> 00:00:54.472
- Still friends! Yeah.

00:00:54.472 --> 00:00:55.305
- I love him. Yeah.

00:00:55.305 --> 00:00:58.350
I want to give a public
apology to Braeden Lemasters.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:00:59.490
- I am sorry as well.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:01.710
- From Kelly Clarkson
and myself. I'm sorry.

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:04.050
- How dare I plan a tour on that day?

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:05.580
- Damn you. Damn you.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:06.660
- That's just hilarious.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:08.118
I heard that story. I
was like, is that real?

00:01:08.118 --> 00:01:08.951
- [Lukas Gage] Oh, it's real.

00:01:08.951 --> 00:01:11.283
- My friends would never
let me live that down.

